    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56900" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέρνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, <i><span class="en">
			Ammon.
		</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
			Ath.
			11.476f
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i> (pl.):—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέρνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, Sch.<i><span class="en">
