			Poll.
			4.103
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>earthen dish
				with small pots affixed for miscellaneous offerings</i>,
			Ath.l.c., etc.; wrongly expld., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίκνον</span>
			, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				497c
			</span></i>.</div>
